Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=14}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O vulcão submarino está entrando em erupção!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos perto demais dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marujos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos recuar por enquanto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entendido! Capitão Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi! Puxem o navio!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, tá bom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a pessoa mais rica do mundo,\N o grande Capitão Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é péssimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, diga ao Kraken\N para sair daqui imediatamente!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peraí! Não precisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele já tá correndo que nem um louco!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que cena lamentável\N pra um monstro lendário desses!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ótimo! Acho que vai dar tudo certo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele corre de um jeito horrível.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não diga isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é pra ter noção do quão assustadora\N vai ser essa erupção!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E o que é que {\i1}ele{\i0} tá fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uau! Aí sim! Vambora!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É a reabilitação!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas eu quero ver a erupção!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuem pra proa do navio!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso não muda nada!\N São apenas alguns metros.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A lava está fluindo pelo fundo do mar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A temperatura está subindo muito!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu me sinto como se tivesse em água fervente!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos cozinhar aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.37,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá quente! Tá quente!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O navio fantasma e o monge do mar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Corre, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você consegue!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vai mais rápido, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ou você vai virar polvo cozido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Polvo cozido? Parece uma delícia! Eu quero comer um pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Por causa da diferença de temperatura,\N a corrente está começando a girar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Srta. Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,para que lado fica a Ilha dos Homens-Peixe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Até num momento desses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, foca na sua reabilitação!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1019)}Direto em frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos chegando perto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pule naquela fossa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lá dentro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,922)}É um precipício!\N Você só pode tá de brincadeira!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É um breu absoluto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem certeza de que a Ilha dos Homens-Peixe\N fica lá embaixo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá muito quente ali atrás!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá completamente escuro\N ali na frente! Que medo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tenho certeza de que vai ter outro monstro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acho que não vai dar pra sair dessa com vida!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa escuridão é um caldeirão sem fundo\N que dá direto no inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uma panela de ferro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uma chaleira! Cha-Chaleira!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pula com tudo, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá entrando em erupção de novo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bem acima de nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rochas?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É uma avalanche de pedras e terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É por causa da erupção!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuja, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu vou sair e cortar elas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Segura firme na minha perna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:57.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, saquei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, não!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, me solta!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós estamos agora a 8 mil metros\N de profundidade!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Se você sair, será esmagado\N pela pressão da água!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então o que a gente faz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deixa comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Estrela Verde Mortal...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sargaço!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brotou uma alga-marinha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que demais, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso vai segurar só por um tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agora é a chance de dar no pé, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bem na hora!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, isso foi massa demais!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sim, foi uma excelente decisão!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Mamão com açúcar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deu tudo certo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surume, você também foi jóia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos a salvo agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Ei!\N– Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume!\N– Surume! Opa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Vamo lá!\N– Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume!\N– Surume! Opa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Su...\N– Su...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu... Eu tô vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luz?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tão fundo no mar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quanta claridade! Meus olhos estão ofuscados!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas eu não tenho olhos para serem ofuscados.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, galera, vem cá!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olhem ali!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não consigo ver, tá muito claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, Nami, é ali?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sim, sem dúvida nenhuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A agulha está apontando para a ilha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquilo é...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Ilha dos Homens-Peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É grandona mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Está dentro de uma bolha enorme!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.44,0:08:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquilo são nuvens?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez tenha ar lá dentro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É isso aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A gente conseguiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É um ponto turístico\N muito popular na Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eles conseguiram mesmo chegar lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As sereias dançam por aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lindas sereias!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu finalmente consegui chegar lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O paraíso dos meus sonhos de criança!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Viva! Viva! Viva! Viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:46.48,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Super! Super! Super! Super! Super! Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sereia! Sereia!\N– Sereia! Sereia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sereia!\N– Serei...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Você não tá pronto!\N Não devia nem pensar nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me desculpa, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A reabilitação ainda não funcionou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você não deveria olhar\N para sereias de verdade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Médico!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Era o sonho dele ver as sereias\N da Ilha dos Homens-Peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas ele vai morrer se vê-las!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não pode ser!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu não me importo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Em vez de viver mais tempo\N sem um sonho pra me guiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prefiro morrer olhando cheio de tesão\N pra aquelas sereias!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seu lixo imundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu vou olhar pras sereias!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele tá queimando!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As chamas do erotismo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não vejo a hora!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que tipo de carne será que eles comem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, limpa a baba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você pode dar uma ordem ao Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos procurar a entrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:02.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, o que é aquilo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Por que você está obedecendo\N a esses humanos estúpidos,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kraken?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quem são esses aí?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O grupo de monstros marinhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ferrou de vez! Logo agora\N que acabamos de chegar aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eles são tão maneiros! Só tem monstrão!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem alguém montado em um deles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1442,27)}O que você tá fazendo, Surume?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1442,27)}A gente tava quase lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Acabamos ficando bem no meio\N dos monstros marinhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Vocês são o Bando do Chapéu de Palha, não são?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu lhes conheço muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foram vocês que arruinaram\N os planos dos Piratas do Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa parte é fácil de entender.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Mas então, dois anos atrás, vocês defenderam o Hachi{-san},\N ex-membro desse mesmo Bando do Arlong...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,e deram uma surra em um daqueles\N Dragões Celestiais asquerosos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Igualzinho o Fisher Tiger, o herói da Ilha dos Homens-Peixe,\N que nós tanto respeitamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fisher... Tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Isso tudo só dificulta\N decidir o que fazer com vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Então, me digam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Vocês são nossos amigos ou inimigos?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Vou lhes dar uma escolha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aceitam se submeter ao comando\N dos Novos Piratas Homens-Peixe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ou preferem recusar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Se recusarem, vamos afundar vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como é que é?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, abasteça!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.71,0:12:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã? O que você vai fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você sabe muito bem que o Luffy e os outros\N não vão se submeter a eles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas estamos a 10 mil metros de profundidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não temos nem como lutar,\N quanto mais vencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então vamos fugir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Faça o Coup de Burst usando todo o ar que temos\N e entre{\q2} com tudo na Ilha dos Homens-Peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá falando sério?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do contrário, vamos todos morrer,\N mesmo depois de chegar tão longe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parece que essa é a única maneira\N de sobrevivermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, tô indo encher o tanque.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, assuma o leme!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beleza, super deixa comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E então, aceita trabalhar sob nossas ordens,\N Luffy do Chapéu de Palha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vai dar não!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bocó!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você recusou...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a oferta para se juntar\N aos Novos Piratas Homens-Peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assim, vocês são, portanto,\N inimigos dos homens-peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meros seres humanos afogados em pecado!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E por que cargas d'água\N a gente devia trabalhar pra vocês?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, para de provocar eles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É uma pena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então não podemos permitir\N que vocês passem deste ponto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É aqui que afundaremos vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leão-marinho!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tudo pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, manda brasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Afunde-os!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Querem briga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vai, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esse nosso {\i1}Sunny{\i0} aqui também é um leão!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Qualquer dia desses\N a gente se enfrenta, leão-marinho!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqui vamos nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O navio está...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamo perdendo ar...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos ser esmagados...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu não consigo respirar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apesar de não ter pulmões.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aguentem firme! Até chegarmos\N na Ilha dos Homens-Peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Qual é a daquele navio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos entrando!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esperem por mim, minhas queridas sereias!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O revestimento saiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ficou preso na bolha gigante!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olhem para frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,514)}Esta bolha possui duas camadas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como essa camada contém apenas ar,\N os navios comuns acabam caindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos atravessar mais uma bolha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Segurem firme!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Água?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:36.05,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2181,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}A correnteza é muito forte!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So... corro...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1216,0,1,\c&H000000&}Não consigo respirar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:49.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós temos quatro usuários\N de Fruta do Diabo, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(685,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Tenho que...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...alcançar eles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.68,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Srta. Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Robinzita!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:11.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:14.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2016,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Não consigo nadar contra essa correnteza!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que jeito mais maluco de entrar.\N Talvez eles tenham tentado se suicidar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quer ir atrás deles, Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não dá nem pra saber\N se eles ainda estão vivos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, mas nós vamos entrar sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninguém aqui quer que o Exército de Neptune\N encontre eles primeiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas antes, vamos voltar para a Noah\N e avisar ao Chefe que...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o Chapéu de Palha que destruiu\N a ambição do mestre Arlong está aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, olha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vou olhar mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vou nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu olhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu olhei, e daí?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, ele tá se mexendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mexeu mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mexeu nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez ele tenha se mexido mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele se mexeu, e daí?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eba, ele acordou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyto!{zenef decide something about this please thank you}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que bom que você está bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como está se sentindo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É você, Camie! Quanto tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você ficou ainda mais linda, Camiezita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A gente chegou na Ilha dos Homens-Peixe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chegamos sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me disseram que estávamos nos afogando,\N mas umas sereias nos salvaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.97,0:18:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Na verdade, nós também acabamos de acordar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esta é a casa da Camiezita.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqui, seu chapéu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, então essa é a casa da Camie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Desculpinha aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:21.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu ia buscar vocês, mas achei\N que era só daqui um mês.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Relaxa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cadê o resto da galera?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bem...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parece que nos separamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Espero que eles estejam bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Sim, eu segui eles até certo ponto,\N mas eles acabaram sendo levados para outro lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Bom, tenho certeza que eles vão saber se virar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Também acho.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}O caveirão não pode fazer muita coisa no mar...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,mas eles estão com o robô e o verdoso,\N então vão ficar bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu também quero ver os outros logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, tomem aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sei que todos vocês\N devem estar congelando.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu fiz sopa, então tomem um pouco\N e se aqueçam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tcham-ram!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sopa fria de algas-marinhas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão adorar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sopa fria?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unrum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não dá pra se aquecer com sopa fria!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E agora?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como é?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu errei feio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, Camiezita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ela me esquenta de qualquer jeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como isso é possível?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, Sanji! Eu também quero um pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suas roupas secaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Secaram mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Secaram nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez tenham secado.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Secaram mesmo, e daí?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você colocou nossas roupas pra secar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Obrigado!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Valeu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A propósito, quem são vocês?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, elas são minhas amigas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As Quíntuplas Sereias Medaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a Umka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a Doiska!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a Trêska!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a Quatroka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a Quatroka Dois!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E não dava pra ser Quintaka por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elas nadam bem rápido e são superinformadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É mesmo, é?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós estamos no fundo\N da Enseada das Sereias.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E este é o dormitório feminino da Cafetereia,\N então eu tenho muitas amigas aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dormitório feminino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Camiezita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que... O que... O que é a Cafetereia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}É uma cafeteria onde eu trabalho como garçonete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem muitas sereias lindas por lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sereias lindas?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aceita uma xícara de café? Ou quem sabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– O Sanji tá...\N– ...em perigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Aguentou!\N– Aguentou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu jurei que jamais teria um sangramento nasal\N nem desmaiaria...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:21:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,na Ilha dos Homens-Peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Então já posso ser recompensado agora, não posso...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que vexame...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(806.14,906.06,1326.21,1080)}Que vexame...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.05,0:21:10.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(931,887.39,1297.7,1080)}Que vexame...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(1053.89,915.89,1338,1080)}Que vexame...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(1178.74,937.5,1290.81,1080)}Que vexame...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, é!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá pra cima!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quero apresentar as minhas amigas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olha só, uma tartaruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Está escrito "Tartaruga-Marinha Elevadora".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tartaruguita, nos leve lá pra cima.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Este é um residencial coralino marinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O dormitório fica bem no fundo,\N então o aluguel é baratinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Já a cobertura recebe luz natural,\N então é bem mais cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então tu é uma lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A propósito, cadê o Hachi e o Pappagu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O Hachito ficou gravemente ferido\N há cerca de um ano.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foi ele que tentou proteger\N o {\i1}Sunny{\i0} lá em Sabãody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouvi dizer que ele já está\N bem recuperado agora...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:22:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}mas o Hachito veio do Distrito dos Homens-Peixe,\N então ele está descansando por lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Distrito dos Homens-Peixe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sim...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}É um lugar meio barra-pesada, mas posso levar vocês lá,\N já que me sinto segura com vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamo dar um pulo lá depois!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho que agradecer ele pessoalmente.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certo, combinado!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quanto ao Pappagu...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele é um estilista muito famoso,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.33,0:22:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,então ele tem uma mansão enorme\N lá no Peixeverly Hills, o bairro nobre daqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho que entregar uns mexilhões lá hoje,\N então venham comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:32.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele num era seu bicho de estimação?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.57,0:22:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Por que você não mora com ele?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.44,0:22:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquele lugar está completamente fora\N do meu orçamento.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Temos mexilhões melhores por aqui,\N de qualquer forma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos quase lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei, o que é aquela coisa ali\N parecida com um canudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, aquilo é...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}uma estrad'água feita por um artesão de bolhas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós e os peixes entramos e...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.59,0:22:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqui, olhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.27,0:23:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chegamos, na superfície!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Viram?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dá pra nadar até no céu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Óia, parece muito da hora!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peraí!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Além disso tudo, ainda tem céu e nuvens\N aqui no fundo do mar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.29,0:23:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oi, Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã? Uma voz feminina!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seus amigos já melhoraram?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqueles piratas que estavam se afogando.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês não passaram pela entrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oiê!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês não parecem tão assustadores assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então entraram ilegalmente?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que radical!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É por isso que eu adoro piratas!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.83,0:24:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É como um conto de fadas da vida real!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.59,0:24:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uma terra de corais! A Enseada das Sereias!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O Sanji tá chorando!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.85,0:24:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele tá chorando mais\N do que quando saiu do Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.39,0:24:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu finalmente encontrei!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Este é o meu All Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1320,1053)}Esse é {\i1}realmente{\i0}\N o seu maior desejo, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deixem-me apresentá-los a vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esse é o Luffyto, o capitão.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É isso aí! Prazer imenso!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que está chorando é o Sanjito.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O do nariz é o Usoppito.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prazerzão!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:24:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O guaxinim é o Chopperito.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.12,0:25:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu sou uma rena!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.15,0:25:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que foi? Por que você está chorando?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vem cá!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.69,0:25:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos dançar na água!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah sim, agora eu entendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é bom demais para ser verdade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu provavelmente vou morrer hoje!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quanto pessimismo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sério, o que aconteceu contigo\N nesses últimos dois anos?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Este é o paraíso com o qual\N você sempre sonhou!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.35,0:25:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cê é uma figura mesmo, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.58,0:25:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Figura coisa nenhuma!\N– Figura coisa nenhuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Entendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.59,0:25:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{\q2}Então o Luffy do Chapéu de Palha finalmente chegou até aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-O que devemos fazer, Chefe?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tragam-no...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,para cá!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=15}===============================DIALOGUE============================
